## STANDING EXECUTION CONSTRAINTS
1. **NO GIT COMMIT / PUSH AUTONOMOUSLY**: Never commit or push without explicit user command (`AGENTS.md` §0.1 & `agent-workflow.md` §1).
2. **STRICT UTF-8 & NO POWERSHELL FILE EDITING**: Never use PowerShell cmdlets (`Set-Content`, `Get-Content`, `-replace`) to modify files. Use native tools (`edit_file`, `write_file`) or Node.js (`fs.*FileSync`) (`AGENTS.md` §0.1).
3. **WINDOWS CLI STANDARD**: Always invoke `npm.cmd` or direct `node` with `WaitMsBeforeAsync: 8000–10000` to avoid PowerShell script execution blocks and background task drops (`agent-workflow.md` §1).
4. **MINIMAL SUPABASE FOOTPRINT**: Ultra-lean queries (no broad `select('*')`), no raw blob ingestion in polling, client-side SVG/Canvas image processing, and in-memory reference caching (`AGENTS.md` §2.24 & `agent-workflow.md` §1.1).
5. **SURGICAL & ATOMIC EDITS**: Single-pass table updates, direct component targeting (no unbounded grep sprees), fast-track test execution (`npm run test:fast`, `npm run test:table`), and no ceremonial `/plan` files for trivial UI edits (`agent-workflow.md` §2 & §4).
6. **STUDENT NAME & DASHBOARD-ONLY TITLE**: Standard authentic student name (`studentName`) everywhere across system; `Mr.` and `Miss` titles strictly exclusive to Student Dashboard greeting (`AGENTS.md` §2.23 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` §2.8).
7. **DUMMY ACCOUNT & AVATAR COMPACTION**: Canonical dummy name strictly "Top"; ultra-compact SVG data URIs (~500 bytes) with zero-egress storage (`AGENTS.md` §2.24 & §2.25).
8. **ZERO-TRUNCATION & MASTER EDIT GRIDLINES**: Table cells and headers zero-truncation; white Excel gridlines in Master Edit Mode (`AGENTS.md` §2.21, §2.22 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md`).
9. **SPATIAL & UNIVERSAL TABLE INVARIANTS**: Single-screen 100vh lock, 10px container gap, 40px Sub Panel & Title Area, 60px CTA Area, universal zero-truncation (calibrated column widths), Centered Loading states, and crisp white Excel gridlines in Master Edit Mode (`.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md`).
10. **UNIVERSAL DESIGN SYSTEM & TYPOGRAPHY GOVERNANCE**: Dual-scale Typography architecture (20px-16px-12px), zero sub-12px, zero emojis, and universal single-source color propagation protocol (SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH COLORING) (`AGENTS.md` §2.10 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` §2, §3).
